      'Creating a dietary-specific Blue Ocean, building freshness as core brand positioning, deepening expertise against HelloFresh\'s shallow entry, and pursuing healthcare partnerships for an unassailable moat, scoring 12/12.',
      'The best competitive strategy isn\'t fighting harder in a Red Ocean, it\'s finding or creating a Blue Ocean where your strengths become decisive advantages and competitors\' scale becomes irrelevant. FreshBite\'s journey from generic meal kit to health-focused platform illustrates how positioning, not resources, determines competitive outcomes.'
