        'Spotify\'s freemium model converts 44% of 600M+ users to paid ($10.99/month), the highest freemium conversion rate among major consumer apps.',
        'Zoom\'s free tier (40-minute meeting limit) drove 300M daily participants, with enterprises converting to paid plans averaging $150K+ annually.',
