      'Dropbox\'s video demonstrated every core GTM principle: (1) Validate demand cheaply, 75,000 signups proved people wanted this. (2) Right channel, a 2-minute video communicated the value proposition better than any ad campaign. (3) Product-led acquisition, the video showed the product in action, driving desire. (4) Capital efficiency, nearly free marketing generated more leads than a $10M campaign could have. GTM strategy is about leverage, not spending.'
