          explanation: 'Quibi raised $1.75 billion and launched a mobile streaming service without PMF, users didn\'t want short-form premium content on their phones (YouTube and TikTok already existed). Six months and $1.75B later, Quibi shut down. They scaled a product nobody wanted.'
