            { label: 'Double down on product-led growth, build viral features (team invitations, shared projects, templates marketplace) that turn every user into an acquisition channel, supplemented by content/SEO', consequence: 'Perfect scaling strategy for a collaboration tool. Project management is inherently viral, every shared project invites new users at zero marginal cost. A templates marketplace creates SEO content that attracts organic traffic. Combined CAC approaches $0 for viral users, dramatically improving unit economics as you scale. This is how Notion, Figma, and Canva scaled.', score: 3 },
            { label: 'Hire a 20-person enterprise sales team to sell to Fortune 500 companies', consequence: 'Enterprise sales is a high-LTV channel, but building from 0 to 20 sales reps takes 12-18 months before meaningful revenue. Average enterprise sales cycle is 6-12 months. With a 50,000-user product-led base, you should leverage existing organic adoption in enterprises before building a dedicated sales team.', score: 1 }
