            { label: 'Partner with them instead, licensing deal for their technology', consequence: 'Licensing gives you access but not ownership. The competitor can license to your rivals too, and they can increase prices or terminate the agreement. A licensing deal provides capability without competitive advantage. In strategy, "rent" is almost always worse than "own" for core capabilities.', score: 0 }
