      { takeaway: 'Solving chicken-and-egg requires creative bootstrapping', detail: 'Seed one side (Uber hired drivers), start in a niche (Airbnb at events), subsidize (PayPal $10), or create standalone value (OpenTable restaurant management). Every platform must solve this to reach critical mass.' }
